WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:03.240
Cameron Todd Willingham,

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:07.540
you're guilty of capital murder 
by order of the state of Texas.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.700
You are sentenced to death.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:15.180
You're my first visitor in a long time.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.060
How long has it been?

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.120
Eight years.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.040
Prisoners talk about doing time

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.120
On the row, there is no time.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.160
The clock stopped moving 
the minute we were sentenced.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.840
How about you tell me what happened?

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:32.480
Daddy!

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:36.200
Girl.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:38.200
Help me.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:40.380
Any man can't save his own kids.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:49.040
I don't deserve to live, 
but I did not kill my own children, Elizabeth.

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.120
I love them more than my life itself.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:58.760
I found myself talking to a vulnerable sensitive man.

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:01.660
I believe the state of Texas 
is about to kill an innocent man.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:05.460
You failed to challenge 
witnesses that changed their story.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:09.820
He had the motive, which means 
that boy is a monster and he will die.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.100
His lawyer decided Todd was guilty from the get-go.

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:16.100
He failed to find a single scientific expert.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.780
It doesn't mean he's innocent.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:20.040
Don't let your emotions get the better.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.220
My emotions, what? Cuz I'm a woman?

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.560
Right, I'm gonna go finish your job for you.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:32.420
You ever read man's search for meaning 
who says to live is to suffer and to survive.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.500
You got to find meaning in the suffering.

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.060
I want to live. 
That's why we're not gonna give up.

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:40.440
Why do you think Todd Willingham confessed to you?

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:41.740
I suppose talk about this stuff

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:43.820
Do not to talk about it to the district attorney

00:01:43.829 --> 00:01:45.800
They are gonna kill an innocent person.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:46.600
I got a gun.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.020
Get out of here.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:53.260
These so-called experts didn't even bother 
to check the space heater.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:55.460
There's no person. There's no crime.

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:59.820
It ain't gonna make no difference 
as I'm not here to be safe. I am here to die.

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:03.240
But chance we caught, honestly.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.400
You think this is just about tar?

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:09.040
System doesn't work. It's broken.

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:11.260
These are my last days.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.360
If I start hoping, he's gonna go by just like that.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:19.180
I understand, but I'm open.

